Blurt bundles no model weights. Models are downloaded at runtime from
HuggingFace and stored in the user's own application data directory.

Speech recognition uses NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2, in the ONNX conversion
published at https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-onnx
(upstream: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2).
